{"id":114,"verses":[{"index":1,"arabic":"قُلۡ أَعُوذُ بِرَبِّ ٱلنَّاسِ","english":"Say, \"I seek refuge in the Lord of mankind"},{"index":2,"arabic":"مَلِكِ ٱلنَّاسِ","english":"The Sovereign of mankind"},{"index":3,"arabic":"إِلَٰهِ ٱلنَّاسِ","english":"The God of mankind"},{"index":4,"arabic":"مِن شَرِّ ٱلۡوَسۡوَاسِ ٱلۡخَنَّاسِ","english":"From the evil of the retreating whisperer"},{"index":5,"arabic":"ٱلَّذِي يُوَسۡوِسُ فِي صُدُورِ ٱلنَّاسِ","english":"Who whispers [evil] into the breasts of mankind"},{"index":6,"arabic":"مِنَ ٱلۡجِنَّةِ وَٱلنَّاسِ","english":"From among the jinn and mankind"}]}